    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really? u think its fine cuz i haven't had a bad attack in like 2 years. i don't want to risk a hospital trip lol, but the shaking is making me so anxious i might mess up the presentation. what dosage should i take just to be safe? like if i take a little more it'll work better right?",
