      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok i'll just stick to one. honestly though i'm a bit worried about the chest tightness thing you mentioned. if i start feeling a little wheezy or if it feels like my breathing is getting tight, should i just take a puff of my albuterol inhaler and then take another propranolol to make sure the anxiety is actually gone? i dont want to have to deal with the shaking during the meeting",
